{"id":"anblick","lemma":"Anblick","pos":"noun","rank":2543,"glosses":["view, sight, look"],"ipa":"/ˈʔanblɪk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/11/De-Anblick.ogg/De-Anblick.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Anblickes","plural":"Anblicke"},"examples":[{"text":"Welch ein Anblick!","en":"What a sight!","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Was für ein Anblick!","en":"What a sight!","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Ich kann seinen Anblick nicht ertragen.","en":"I can't bear the sight of him.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to bear"}]},{"text":"Es war kein schöner Anblick.","en":"It wasn't a pretty sight.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"well, beautifully","l":"schön"},null]},{"text":"Sie zitterte beim Anblick.","en":"She shivered at the sight.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to shiver","l":"zittern"},{"g":"at the"},null]}]}